{"id":"604621","name":"鸡蛋火腿炒饼丝","author":"优子家的味道","authorId":"9910251","desc":"","cover":"images/604621/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"饼丝","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"4个"},{"name":"火腿肠","amount":"1根"},{"name":"青椒","amount":"1个"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"1个"},{"name":"茴子白","amount":"半个"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"葱姜蒜。","img":"images/604621/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"青椒切丝。","img":"images/604621/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洋葱切丝。","img":"images/604621/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"茴子白切丝。","img":"images/604621/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"火腿肠切片。","img":"images/604621/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"鸡蛋。","img":"images/604621/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"饼丝。","img":"images/604621/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"鸡蛋提前炒好备用。","img":"images/604621/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"油热后下入菜码。","img":"images/604621/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"炒香后放入火腿肠。","img":"images/604621/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入料酒、酱油。","img":"images/604621/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"炒拌均匀。","img":"images/604621/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"随后放入青椒、洋葱、茴子白。","img":"images/604621/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"依次放入盐、十三香、南德调味料。","img":"images/604621/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"炒拌均匀。","img":"images/604621/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"断生后放入饼丝，倒入酱油、蚝油。","img":"images/604621/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"炒拌均匀后放入炒好的鸡蛋。","img":"images/604621/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"放入味精、鸡精。","img":"images/604621/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"炒拌均匀即可。","img":"images/604621/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"美味漂亮，营养丰富，好吃看得见！","img":"images/604621/step_20.jpg"}],"tips":"饼丝可以买成品，也可买烙饼自己切。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}